WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_18h.avi
Scene: Squall and Rinoa escaping the Memorial
Duration: approximately 5 seconds
Describes the rapid escape sequence from the Sorceress Memorial.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Squall pulls Rinoa from the broken crystalline chamber. She emerges gasping, regaining consciousness. His expression shows relief and urgency combined.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
They run together down the white corridors of the Sorceress Memorial. Behind them, alarms blare. The pursuit is on, but Squall holds Rinoa's hand firmly. They will escape together.